    "BigQuery in plain words",
    "Key idea:  BigQuery is Google's online database for very large tables. GA4 can copy every single page view and click into it each day. You then ask questions in SQL, a language that reads almost like English.",
    "GA4 reports vs BigQuery",
    "GA4 reports are like ready-made meals: quick, but you choose from the menu.",
    "BigQuery is the kitchen with all the raw ingredients: every event, one row each. You can cook any analysis, including ones GA4 reports cannot do.",
